  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>We know that expression inside log is dimensionless.</p><p>Therefore,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is dimensionless</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>&#946;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>ML</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>MLT</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Since&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi></math>&nbsp;is dimensionless&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>p</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>&#945;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>&#946;</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>&#945;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>MLT</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
